## ============================================================
## Epilogue — end of the test scenario
## ============================================================

> "[epilogue] You have reached the end of the test scenario."

:hero: > "[epilogue] Final state: HP={hero.hp}, Gold={hero.gold}, Mood={hero.mood}"

[if hero.hp > 50]
    > "[epilogue if] You finished strong."
[else]
    > "[epilogue else] You finished wounded."
[/if]

[audio music "/audio/ambient_loop.wav" bgm_final "0.5~2000" "1.0"/]
> "[epilogue audio] Final music fading in."

> "[epilogue] Thank you for testing DreamRun."
